# Two-worker printer queue regression.  The follower is earlier in entity
# order than the customer at the front: the game's final serve link stages the
# customer's step, then next-frame arbitration swaps their claims atomically.
# That order makes the follower's body begin one frame later and exposes both
# an omitted tail-step link and an over-broad transparent-worker shortcut.
name Printer Queue
dim 3 4
ent printer 1 3
ent worker 1 1
ent worker 1 2
goal all_workers_holding
